error[E0450]: `Pair<fun()>` can't be turned into JSON: `a` is a function
  --> tests/programs/derive/with/generic_use.la:7:13
  |
7 |     let v = json.encode(Pair { a: fun() {}, b: fun() {} });
  |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
